  "eer_rule": {
    "rule": "scores sorted ascending once per system; FRR and FAR accumulated as weighted cumulative sums; the operating point is argmin|FRR-FAR| and the EER is their mean at that point. No interpolation between adjacent thresholds. The SAME routine (weighted_eer) computes the observed statistic and every replicate; only the weight vector differs.",
